{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    美股｜黃仁勳言論打擊CoreWeave 美IPO停滯 多企業聯手擴Grok商業應用           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">2026年10月23日多項環球科技及金融市場消息出爐。英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳的相關言論導致CoreWeave股價受壓，市場憂慮其新雲業務擴張面臨營運資金不足問題。美國10月新股集資總額不足6億美元，市場寄望Anthropic下月上市打破新股市場停滯局面。SpaceX聯同英偉達等逾130間企業，共同擴大Grok的商業應用範圍，相關AI代理付費用戶倍增。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T23:44:38.608441+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:00:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T03:58:49.775015+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T23:38:58.548730+00:00","content_hash":"52f82f93ea80705d99825f6767eb8c6231839a3c8e658c13432adbd33eb96e9b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}